Requirements: cmake >= 3.20, a C11 compiler with OpenMP (gcc, clang/LLVM, icx).

    git submodule update --init      # pulls OIFITSlib
    cmake -B build
    cmake --build build -j

The binary is written to ./bin/squeeze.

See Readme.md section 2 for build options and platform notes (in particular
OpenMP on macOS, where Apple's bundled clang lacks the OpenMP runtime).
